WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.220
Like the graveyard in Mossville, Morning Star Cemetery.

2
00:00:06.220 --> 00:00:11.540
My mom wanted to kind of like upgrade it,

3
00:00:11.540 --> 00:00:22.820
and she would ask people that had people in the . . . buried in the cemetery to come and help her paint the graves,

4
00:00:22.820 --> 00:00:27.640
repair the graves, and just keep it clean.

5
00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:36.960
Well, she got a little help, but she said, "I'm not going to keep begging people to help me do this."

6
00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:47.600
So she bought all the paint and she would . . . Every two weeks my mom took her own money and paid somebody,

7
00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:52.340
paid Archie [Prior?] to cut the graveyard.

8
00:00:52.340 --> 00:00:57.320
And she would go down there and she would sit and be sure it was done right.

9
00:00:57.320 --> 00:01:04.760
And she paid to have the graves cleaned and painted on her own, out of her own pocket.

10
00:01:04.760 --> 00:01:08.060
And after she died . . . Well,

11
00:01:08.060 --> 00:01:19.980
it's grown up a lot and I would like to do more back there, but it's so secluded till it’s dangerous.

12
00:01:19.980 --> 00:01:21.400
Where is the cemetery located?

13
00:01:21.400 --> 00:01:28.120
It's in Mossville, and it was behind the church which was torn down.

14
00:01:28.120 --> 00:01:36.060
I had talked to . . . I can't think of his name at Sasol about the graveyard.

15
00:01:36.060 --> 00:01:46.940
And I asked him was it possible . . . could he find out who owned the property in the front of the graveyard so it could be cleaned out,

16
00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:51.200
so it wouldn't be . . . You could see all the way to the graveyard.

17
00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:56.440
And now the parish kept the road up to get to the graveyard.

18
00:01:56.440 --> 00:02:03.760
There's a really nice bridge they put there and people used to go back there and dump their trash.

19
00:02:03.760 --> 00:02:14.040
And my mom was able to get a gate put there so you couldn't get . . . They would just throw their trash in.

20
00:02:14.040 --> 00:02:19.780
That was before the trash had to be picked up door to door.

21
00:02:19.780 --> 00:02:24.760
But after she died the graveyard has just gone down.

22
00:02:24.760 --> 00:02:31.720
It's because nobody is doing what my mom took it on her own to doing.
